  <a href="/tutorial/sql-introduction/" class="course-card group xl:col-span-3 relative overflow-hidden rounded-[24px] border border-indigo-100 bg-gradient-to-br from-white via-indigo-50/70 to-violet-100/70 p-6 sm:p-7 shadow-[0_12px_35px_rgba(15,23,42,0.06)] transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-[0_20px_45px_rgba(79,70,229,0.14)]"><div class="absolute -right-8 -top-10 h-40 w-40 rounded-full bg-indigo-200/50 blur-2xl"></div><div class="absolute right-5 top-5 text-indigo-300/80" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 80 70" class="h-20 w-24"><ellipse cx="34" cy="16" rx="23" ry="9" fill="currentColor"/><path fill="currentColor" d="M11 16v31c0 5 10 10 23 10s23-5 23-10V16H11Z"/><ellipse cx="34" cy="47" rx="23" ry="9" fill="#4338ca"/><rect x="51" y="35" width="24" height="20" rx="5" fill="#4f46e5"/><text x="63" y="50" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" font-weight="900" fill="#fff">SQL</text></svg></div><div class="relative min-h-[300px] sm:min-h-[320px] flex flex-col"><span class="self-start rounded-full bg-indigo-100 px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-bold text-indigo-700">Database</span><div class="mt-6 pr-24"><h3 class="text-3xl font-black text-slate-950">SQL</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm sm:text-[15px] leading-6 text-slate-600">Learn relational databases, query design, joins, filtering, indexing, and data management.</p></div><div class="mt-auto"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 text-sm text-slate-500"><span>📚 14 chapters</span><span>◷ ~4 hours</span></div><div class="mt-5 inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center gap-3 rounded-full bg-indigo-600 px-5 py-3.5 text-sm font-extrabold text-white shadow-lg shadow-indigo-600/20 transition group-hover:bg-indigo-700">Start SQL <span class="text-lg transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1">→</span></div></div></div></a>
